      "text": "準備がいいな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……今日は、少し決めてたから。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "何を？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "逃げないこと。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "言わなくていい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "まだ何も言ってない。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "言いそうだった。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "ばれたか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "ばれる。\n――夜空はベンチの前で立ち止まり、少し迷ってから座る。\n店長は少し距離を空けて隣に座った。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "その距離。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "近いか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "ちょうどいい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そっか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "言わなくていい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。\n――夜空はホットココアの缶を両手で包む。\n今日はすでに少しぬるくなっていたが、それでも手には温かかった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "店長。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "ん？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "今日は、逃げない練習。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "だから、途中で変な顔をしても、見ないで。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "わかった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "でも、見てて。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……わかった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "今、困ったでしょ。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "少し。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "ぼくも困ってる。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そっか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "言わなくていい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。\n――夜空はしばらく缶を見つめる。\nそれから、小さく息を吸った。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "探してくれて、ありがとう。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "言わないで。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "見つけてくれて、ありがとう。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……うん。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "帰らないでいてくれて、ありがとう。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……うん。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "あの時、何も言わなくても、そこにいてくれて……ありがとう。\n――夜空の声は小さい。\nけれど、はっきり届いた。\n言い終えた瞬間、夜空は缶をぎゅっと握りしめ、顔をそらした。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "夜空。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "なに。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "言ってくれてありがとう。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "だから、お礼を言うところじゃない。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "でも、言ってくれたから。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……そういうところ。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "ずるい？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "うん。\nでも、今日は逃げない。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……今、すごく帰りたい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "恥ずかしいから？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "聞き返さないで。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "悪い。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "でも、逃げない。\n練習だから。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……うん、も言わなくていい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "難しいな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "難しくしてるのは、ぼく。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "それも、だいぶ自分で言えるようになったな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "褒めないで。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "今のは褒めた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "褒めないでって言った。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "でも、言いたかった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……ずるい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "今日は逃げないんだろ？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "逃げないけど、怒ることはできる。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "それは怖いな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "怖くない。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "じゃあ、少し怒ってる？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……少し。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そっか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "でも、嫌じゃない。\n――夜空はそう言って、ココアを一口飲む。\n甘さに少しだけ眉を動かして、それから缶を膝の上に置いた。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "甘い。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "前より慣れたか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……少し。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そっか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "言わなくていい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "でも、今日はいい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "いいのか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "うん。\n今日は、少しだけ素直になる練習だから。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "十分素直だと思う。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "そういうことを言うから。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "悪い。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "でも、今日は逃げない。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。\n――風が吹く。\n夜空は少しだけ肩をすくめる。\n店長は何か言いかけて、やめた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "今、寒いかって聞こうとした？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "言わないでおいた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……寒い。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "上着は？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "着てる。\nでも、少し寒い。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "戻るか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "まだいい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "無理はするなよ。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "してない。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "その大丈夫は信用していいやつか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……今日は、信用していい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "わかった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "美空みたいなこと言う。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "美空なら聞くと思った。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "うん。\n絶対聞く。\n――夜空は少しだけ笑った。\n今度は、すぐに否定しなかった。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "今、笑ったな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……笑った。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "認めた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "今日は逃げない練習だから。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そっか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "言わなくていい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "でも……今日は、まあいい。\n――夜空はもう一度ココアを飲む。\n甘くて、少しぬるくて、でも落ち着く味だった。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "店長。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "ん？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "また、こういうふうに歩いてもいい？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "もちろん。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "即答しないで。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "悪い。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "でも、今のは……少し嬉しかった。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そっか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "言わなくていい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "一人だと、まだ余計なことを考えるから。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "また一緒に歩こう。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……うん。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "店長のうんは、多い。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "安心してほしくて。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "そういうの、すぐ言う。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "悪い。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……でも、嫌じゃない。\n――少し長い沈黙が流れる。\n今度の沈黙は、怖くなかった。\n夜空は缶を両手で包み、夕方の公園を見つめていた。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "店長。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "ん？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "今日は、ここまで。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "わかった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "言いたいことを、全部言えたわけじゃない。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "でも、今日はここまで言えた。",
      "storySprites": [
